{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14215090","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14215090","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421509001:1":{"text":"あっ、待ってください！エントリーします！","source_cn":"等等！我们还没有报名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC58627F97A5F9066","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421509002:1":{"text":"あなた方が？申し訳ありませんが、外部の方はお断りしてるんですよ。","source_cn":"你们？外乡人可不能报名参赛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2CC73DDF151F6FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421509003:1":{"text":"違います！参加するのはヴェインさんです！","source_cn":"是瓦恩！瓦恩要报名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64A8B83C39176505","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421509004:1":{"text":"……ぼ、僕が……出場したいんです！","source_cn":"……我……想要报名！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E0017366F5AC398","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421509005:1":{"text":"やっと来たか、ヴェイン。で、指導者は見つけたのか？","source_cn":"瓦恩终于来了啊。找到人指导你了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x608EBA75860C971A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1421509006:1":{"text":"こ、このお二人です……ハムスターの先生と、そのマスター……","source_cn":"这、这两位……仓鼠小兄弟和他的主人……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x48DAA56674E73AB5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"こ、このお二人です……ハムスターの先生と、そのマスター……","female":"こ、このお二人です……ハムスターの先生と、そのマスター……","variant_male_record_index":"163482","variant_female_record_index":"163483","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1421509007:1":{"text":"外部の者を指導役に？……ほほう。だが、人数が多ければいいというものではない。まあ、そのうち分かるだろう。","source_cn":"请外乡人来指导……有意思。不过可不是指导的人越多就越好...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8FDD49582B6A7FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:12:1421509008:1":{"text":"すべての参加者のエントリーが終了し……","source_cn":"","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x458A8E50C2B30294","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"すべての参加者のエントリーが終了し……","female":"すべての参加者のエントリーが終了し……","variant_male_record_index":"163485","variant_female_record_index":"163486","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1421509009:1":{"text":"ただいまをもちまして――今年の鍛魂大会、正式に開幕です！","source_cn":"我宣布，本届锻魂大赛正式开始！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01AE72F9DC29F155","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1421509010:1":{"text":"これより、ルール説明を行います。今回のテーマは――「剣の鍛造」！","source_cn":"下面由我来介绍本次大赛的规则！本次大赛的主题是——锻剑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5737D1982598479","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1421509011:1":{"text":"まずは予選ステージです。参加者の皆様には<style=\"highlight\">主催側が用意した材料</style>のみを使い、制限時間内に合格基準を満たす剣を鍛えていただきます！","source_cn":"淘汰赛阶段，所有选手都要在规定时间内使用主办方提供的材...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x238552C2966F6548","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1421509012:1":{"text":"その後、合格者は決勝ステージへと進むことができます！","source_cn":"达到合格标准的优胜者将进入总决赛，参加最终的比试！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F79292F8A59234B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1421509013:1":{"text":"今大会では、参加者の皆様はご自分の工房での作業が可能です！材料は、主催側から各工房へ直接お届けします。","source_cn":"好消息是，参赛者可以使用自己的工坊锻造！而且主办方会将...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x378AB7660C202B98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1421509014:1":{"text":"ただし、ルール違反はその場で失格となります！","source_cn":"坏消息是，违反比赛规则的参赛者将会立即淘汰！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23A3D8C0CF0BC597","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1421509015:1":{"text":"では皆様、ご自分の工房で最初の試練に備えてください！","source_cn":"现在请各位回到工坊，迎接你们的第一次考验吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E329AAB7FB5075","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"",